WEBVTT

open-release-desk
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.078
Start with the release
workspace in a real browser.

prepare-release
00:00:08.158 --> 00:00:12.058
The synthetic pointer moves
to each declared target.

enter-version
00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:15.813
Camera zoom follows the
same target rectangle.

request-approval
00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:19.318
Submit the release for
a final human decision.

frame-human-review
00:00:19.398 --> 00:00:23.148
PlainTake hands the visible
browser to a person.

approve-release
00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:30.360
The person approves, and the
recorded scenario can continue.

show-approved-state
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.190
The final state is visible
and ready to verify.
